\f0 \cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable><!$Scr_Ps::1><$Scr_Ps::0>
\f1\fs22 And so, to political assassination:\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>It\'92s not as if the newly ensconced Commissioner of Ulyssia Police Incorporated didn\'92t deserve it; quite apart from cutting the cloth of Halo\'92s missions against the grain, he was a personally appointed stooge of the CEO, yet another position in the law, order and caching-in institutions filled by a fellow regular Sunday attendee at the Prosperity Mountain Church of Exclusive Faith. Halo hated religious types, the worst kinds of sanctimonious gatekeepers.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Killing the Commissioner was the easy part\'97Halo was a PAPER agent, after all. Disposing of the body according to his designs would be more intricate. It was one of Halo\'92s more vindictive and artful works: the body duly found its way to a dog food processing plant; the small batch of product containing the body logistically traced; a sufficient number of crates acquired; the ten ugliest stray dogs in Halo\'92s neighbourhood fed for nearly a fortnight; their faecal waste dutifully collected, bagged, stuffed into effigies dressed in white supremacist garb, which were tied to stakes and planted on the lawns of Prosperity Mountain Church\'92s headquarters and set on fire.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Satisfied, Halo considered the whole endeavour a good vacation.\
\pard\pardeftab360\sl360\slmult1\partightenfactor0

