<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable><!$Scr_Ps::1><$Scr_Ps::0>
\f1\fs22 The retirement of the Commissioner produced another side-effect welcomed by more than Halo among the security industry: a senior vacancy into which could be inserted someone who served better interests than the power-grubbing religious elite. PAPER had many long-embedded moles in the Ulyssia Police. With the unfortunate disappearance of the previous commissioner, one of those moles, with a little crafty manoeuvring would take the office.\

